{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Surreal Deal ",
    "steam_appid": 1886110,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1886110/extras/3a87e50bcb637743174f40153d29cb7b.webp?t=1746721876\" /></div> Are you looking for a job that would be fun and exciting? With each new day bringing new and unexpected events? Well, look no more! \u201cSurreal Deal\u201d is hiring!                      <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1886110/extras/a9d25229a51062bffd50ed8e478fe5cc.webp?t=1746721876\" /></div><i>Mention cut hours and health insurance, that\u2019s the most important part.</i><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1886110/extras/3a87e50bcb637743174f40153d29cb7b.webp?t=1746721876\" /></div>It\u2019s like your regular old salesmanship, expect no more annoying human customers!!! Now you\u2019ll get to see some abstract and extravagant beings from a parallel dimension!!! To be honest, the store itself will be positioned in said dimension!!! Renovations every day! Be sure not to live any valuables behind!!!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1886110/extras/a9d25229a51062bffd50ed8e478fe5cc.webp?t=1746721876\" /></div><i>That\u2019s how I lost my watch on the second day. Hope the store won\u2019t be covered in clocks next time I enter.</i><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1886110/extras/3a87e50bcb637743174f40153d29cb7b.webp?t=1746721876\" /></div>Your job is to satisfy everyone! Listen, understand and bring something hand-picked for THEM and them only. They seem unsatisfied? Angry? Resolve, beg, speak! There\u2019s always a way to the person\u2019s heart! <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1886110/extras/a9d25229a51062bffd50ed8e478fe5cc.webp?t=1746721876\" /></div><i>They mind be all heart themselves. </i><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1886110/extras/3a87e50bcb637743174f40153d29cb7b.webp?t=1746721876\" /></div>No more performance evaluations and salary cuts \u2014 we\u2019re happy with any thing you\u2019ll bring back, and, we hope you\u2019ll be happy with it too! Because that\u2019s what you\u2019ll take home as payment for the day!!!! Hope you can find joy in small things!!!! <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1886110/extras/a9d25229a51062bffd50ed8e478fe5cc.webp?t=1746721876\" /></div><i>And hope you have no family to feed.</i><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1886110/extras/3a87e50bcb637743174f40153d29cb7b.webp?t=1746721876\" /></div>Oh, Albatross, you have a family that feeds you.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1886110/extras/a9d25229a51062bffd50ed8e478fe5cc.webp?t=1746721876\" /></div><i>Eating leftovers from a family restaurant doesn\u2019t count.</i><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1886110/extras/3a87e50bcb637743174f40153d29cb7b.webp?t=1746721876\" /></div>I bet everyone from Phil\u2019s family will be happy to feed you!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1886110/extras/a9d25229a51062bffd50ed8e478fe5cc.webp?t=1746721876\" /></div><i>Don\u2019t get too sidetracked. </i><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1886110/extras/3a87e50bcb637743174f40153d29cb7b.webp?t=1746721876\" /></div>Yeah!!! Sure, where were we?<br><br>Surreal Deals is what it is \u2014 a game about dealmaking in a surreal world (the deals are too, we assure you, very surreal). You play as Al, a new employee, who's tasked with making said deals happen.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>~ In Our Game You Can ~</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Take fun quizzes with you boss or your customers!<br></li><li>Load your sauce-thrower with glue! <i>(not edible)</i><br></li><li>Ride your bike!<br></li><li>Learn new sick dance moves!<br></li><li>Make pizza no one ever allowed you to <i>(within a list of ingredients)</i><br></li><li>Listen to on-the-spot poetry!<br></li><li>Take an autograph from your childhood idol!<br></li><li>Become invested in a cooking gacha game <i>(cute girls guaranteed!!!!)</i><br></li><li>Have fun! <i>(honestly, it\u2019s the only thing we want you to do)</i></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1886110/extras/3a87e50bcb637743174f40153d29cb7b.webp?t=1746721876\" /></div> Are you looking for a job that would be fun and exciting? With each new day bringing new and unexpected events? Well, look no more! \u201cSurreal Deal\u201d is hiring!                      <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1886110/extras/a9d25229a51062bffd50ed8e478fe5cc.webp?t=1746721876\" /></div><i>Mention cut hours and health insurance, that\u2019s the most important part.</i><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1886110/extras/3a87e50bcb637743174f40153d29cb7b.webp?t=1746721876\" /></div>It\u2019s like your regular old salesmanship, expect no more annoying human customers!!! Now you\u2019ll get to see some abstract and extravagant beings from a parallel dimension!!! To be honest, the store itself will be positioned in said dimension!!! Renovations every day! Be sure not to live any valuables behind!!!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1886110/extras/a9d25229a51062bffd50ed8e478fe5cc.webp?t=1746721876\" /></div><i>That\u2019s how I lost my watch on the second day. Hope the store won\u2019t be covered in clocks next time I enter.</i><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1886110/extras/3a87e50bcb637743174f40153d29cb7b.webp?t=1746721876\" /></div>Your job is to satisfy everyone! Listen, understand and bring something hand-picked for THEM and them only. They seem unsatisfied? Angry? Resolve, beg, speak! There\u2019s always a way to the person\u2019s heart! <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\