=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1886110/extras/3a87e50bcb637743174f40153d29cb7b.webp?t=1746721876\" /></div>Yeah!!! Sure, where were we?<br><br>Surreal Deals is what it is \u2014 a game about dealmaking in a surreal world (the deals are too, we assure you, very surreal). You play as Al, a new employee, who's tasked with making said deals happen.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>~ In Our Game You Can ~</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Take fun quizzes with you boss or your customers!<br></li><li>Load your sauce-thrower with glue! <i>(not edible)</i><br></li><li>Ride your bike!<br></li><li>Learn new sick dance moves!<br></li><li>Make pizza no one ever allowed you to <i>(within a list of ingredients)</i><br></li><li>Listen to on-the-spot poetry!<br></li><li>Take an autograph from your childhood idol!<br></li><li>Become invested in a cooking gacha game <i>(cute girls guaranteed!!!!)</i><br></li><li>Have fun! <i>(honestly, it\u2019s the only thing we want you to do)</i></li></ul>",
